{
 "esm": "1.2.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mod_floor_unflatten_static",
  "description": "A flat index unflattened by mod/floor arithmetic, `X[1 + mod(i-1, 2), 1 + floor((i-1)/2)]` written with `floor` (the rrtm `pfrac_bNN_flat` shape), on an observed, a parameter and an inline `const` base. Static variant: no state, so every value is a build-time observed.",
  "authors": [
   "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
  ],
  "tags": [
   "native",
   "conformance"
  ]
 },
